    "id": "DF/057",
    "title": "Defence Artificial Intelligence Centre (DAIC) Strategic Partner",
    "description": "The Strategic Partner will work proactively with the Defence Artificial Intelligence Centre (DAIC) to provide thought leadership that will progressively architect the overall DAIC, and harness the AI ecosystem to stay ahead of other competing nations. In the near term, expertise will also be needed to develop a compelling and cogent strategic baseline plan with scalable options on how the DAIC can mature at pace to satisfy users, senior defence staff, and political expectations.\r\n\r\nThis requirement will be placed through Crown Commercial Services Framework Reference RM6197 - Management Consultancy Framework Three (MCF3).",
